<h2>Plants die. Not because of you.</h2>

<p>Most people do not forget to care. They forget <i>when</i>, and they never learned <i>what</i>.</p>

<step>
  <p anim=rise>Watering too much and too little look the same from the outside.</p>
</step>

<step>
  <p anim=zoom><b>Result:</b> a shelf of expensive green regret.</p>
</step>
